{
  "title": "漏关请求体：POST 拿到意外的 405（实拍）",
  "lines": [
    {"t": "note", "s": "漏配 proxy_pass_request_body off 时："},
    {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -H \"Authorization: ...\" -d payload localhost/protected/data.txt"},
    {"t": "out", "s": "405 Not Allowed"},
    {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -H \"Authorization: ...\" localhost/protected/data.txt"},
    {"t": "out", "s": "SECRET DATA [200]"},
    {"t": "note", "s": "认证服务收到 POST 返回 405，未映射原样漏给客户端"}
  ]
}
